WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.760
ECAFLIP'S SCRATCHING POST

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.480
Don't worry. Your dad always wins.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.000
Before, maybe...

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.680
He wouldn't like hearing that.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:02.920
Even though he's got his arm back,
he hasn't fought for years.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:07.480
I think he's lost his warrior spirit...

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:11.280
You're wrong.
He has fighting in his blood.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:16.760
It's just that with Eva, you and Flopin,
his priorities have changed.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.960
It was best to leave him alone.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.280
He can focus on his fight.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.280
Maybe you are right.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:29.320
You two would make good parents.

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:37.080
Wait!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:43.840
I can't go on.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:48.120
I'm too old for... Well, you know.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.240
We're almost there.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:56.440
You keep saying that.
There's no end to this staircase.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:59.960
And Ruel, he hates endless staircases.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:02.120
Ruel...

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:09.440
I'm way too old for this, Yugo.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.720
I just can't. I'm too old,

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:15.920
too bald, too weak,
basically two teeth...

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.800
Just leave me here.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.720
Ruel!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.400
A Kama?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:36.360
A shiny Kama. I might give it to you
if you stop whining.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.120
Whining?
You could show me a bit more respect!

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.280
Do you have more?

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:49.920
Yes. You'll get them
if you stop complaining.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.640
That's what princesses do.
Don't steal my lines.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:55.760
Okay.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:04:01.960
I'm not as rich as you,
but, as a princess, I have some savings.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.720
Stop whining and it'll be yours.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.520
Do I look like a complainer?

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.200
I think we've arrived.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:24.320
I reckon it's the Ecaflip Temple.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:31.240
Yes. I've told you
how his guardian, Ush,

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:37.040
half-brother to Kerub and Atcham,
a big gambler, almost got us in Ecaflip.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.920
I suppose we go in through that...

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.160
...cat door?

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.920
If we must, boys first.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.080
I'll go.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:00.680
My arthrosis is acting up again!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.880
At my age, I... Hmm?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.760
At my age, everything's fine!

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:16.160
What have we got? Oh.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.240
It looks like...

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.520
...a giant training room!

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.040
Whose idea was this?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.040
Don't stand there staring. Give me a hand!

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.440
Make an effort!

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:50.560
Don't blame us for your big butt.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:54.600
Don't laugh too hard.
If you get your mother's--

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:58.560
Easy, girls.
I'll go to the other side to push.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:05:59.640
What?

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.080
No, wait...

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:03.960
Yugo...

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.080
How dare you?

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.720
I was just helping.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:16.240
By putting your hand on my...?

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:19.200
My bottom! I'm the princess of the--

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.080
A princess in my temple! I'm honored!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:28.960
Ush!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:35.080
Yugo recognized me, flattering.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.160
How have you been?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:43.080
Fine. You know why we're here.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.840
And you won't make it easy for us.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.240
All right! You know I love to gamble.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:53.320
Losing our last game
still sticks in my gut.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:08.440
It's haunting me. I'd never lost before.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.840
No time! Our friends need us.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.480
They are safe.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.520
We're the good guys.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:20.640
I'm sick of hearing that.
You're a bunch of nut-jobs!

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.480
No, Mama!

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:28.760
Give me back my family!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.200
Elely!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.000
She's like her father!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:47.800
You're the one Oropo wants
for an Iop goddess... Why not?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.640
You have a lot to learn!

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.600
Stop rushing without thinking!

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:30.360
As for you...

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.400
What?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.760
No super-Eliatrope-powers here.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.920
An inhibitor!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.560
Like in Justice's prison.
Yeah, that sucks.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:57.080
We'll see how you do without your powers.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.520
The rules are simple.
You're on my scratching post.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:06.320
If you want out, you have to get this key.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:11.760
I'm not sure what you think
you're defending, but I beg you...

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:16.000
You're not very convincing.
I'll teach you how to really beg.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.800
There's time.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.200
Rest a little.

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.320
How can I sleep, Echo?

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:45.160
Everything is falling into place.
I've been waiting for this for centuries.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.880
You've never been so impatient.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.600
Don't worry. We'll support you to the end.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:57.320
-Can I ask you something?
-Yes?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:01.720
You've followed me from the beginning.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.960
Do you believe in my cause or...

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.160
-Or?
-It's just out of love?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:12.800
Interesting question.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.480
A bit of both, I think.
But I believed in your cause first.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.920
That must mean something.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.440
And the others?

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.440
Do they do it for the cause,
or out of love?

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:36.800
Do you know
that your sense of humor is wicked?

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:40.880
I know, I try. They adore and respect you.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.280
How many truly believe in the plan?

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:50.080
They believe in you. It's the same thing.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:56.960
Not quite.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.600
Ush! Stop playing around!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.800
I can't hear you. You're too far!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.440
Not even trying!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:57.800
Spread out. I'll bring him.
Cut off all the exits!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.800
I've got the center.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:07.480
Okay. Better get going.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.200
Give me that key!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.000
How's it going?

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.280
Ush is playing with them.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:30.400
Like a cat with a mouse.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.560
Is all this really useful?

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:38.080
The best way to get to know someone
is to fight them.

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:41.800
What's the point? I can wipe them out.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.800
You know that this isn't goal.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.680
We need your brother.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.560
You already know what I think.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.200
You will never convince Yugo.

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:55.520
I don't need to convince him.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.640
That's not the problem, Adamai.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.840
Part of you wants to see them win.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.360
True... And I have no idea why.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.520
Don't feel guilty.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:13.120
They are endearing,
and fundamentally good.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:17.400
Oropo! It's happening more often.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.960
Don't worry. It'll be fine.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.840
-Are you a little off?
-Let me get my bearings.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.560
Have a nice trip!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.640
Oops?

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.160
Yugo!

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.440
You're just too cute!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:41.320
Ow!

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:43.280
Nasty beast!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.640
Amalia...

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:52.360
It's terrible! They're so cute!

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.480
Get off him!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:02.320
The Brotherhood of the Tofu
taken down by kittens. How pathetic!

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.480
No tickling!

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:30.080
We never get bored with you, my friends.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.400
Little fool!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.400
You protected me.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.480
Really?

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.680
Yes. Don't take me for a fool.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.600
I would never do that. Huh?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.920
Here, kitty, kitty! Come to Daddy Ruel.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:02.280
Hi, kitties. Oh, yes, pretty kitties.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.920
Come and play with Daddy Ruel.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.840
Who's the toy-toy for?

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.880
Kitty-kitty!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.200
I'm the one.

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:23.160
-You all right?
-Yes, nothing serious.

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:29.760
Ready for round two?

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.120
With pleasure, Yugo!

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.520
Are you hurt?

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.680
-No.
-Then why aren't you moving?

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:56.560
Give me back my Kama...

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.920
It's about honor, right?

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.760
I saved you earlier and, as a true Iop,

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.840
something inside you says you owe me.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.760
-Really?
-No.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:24.680
It's a wondrous thing,
don't you think, brother?

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:30.480
Seeing that little girl realizing
what honor really is.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:34.080
With Eva and Percedal,
it was bound to happen.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.160
You won't win this fight.

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:03.920
Without his powers, it's uneven.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.240
I have an idea!

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.200
Catch!

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:06.160
Are you sure this'll work, Elely?

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:11.080
No! But it wouldn't be any fun otherwise.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.360
Here, your friends like Kamas.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.680
You cheated!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:22.320
Not more than you.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.000
Well played.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:33.080
I lost again, but it really was great fun.

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.080
We really should talk someday.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:42.120
You know honor. Why are you here?

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.800
Soon, you'll understand it all.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.480
There is a time for everything.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:55.960
Watch your backs with your next opponent.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:07.520
Papa would like Ush.

